==Battleground==
*1 [[Croco]] spawns.
*Infinite [[Zroco]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 36.67 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**Infinite [[Zroco]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**1 [[Zir Zeal]] spawns.

==Strategy==
The Zir Zeal is the only threat; instead of defending his base, he burrows past your frontline in an attempt to rush down your base with his burrowing range of 1,500.

To beat this level with ease just use [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cats]] or any other fast cat you have to rush and beat the Zir Zeal in the inevitable base race. Make sure to continue to spawn meatshields to fight Zir Zeal so you don't run out of health before you win!

